# Brewfile — managed by chezmoi, installed automatically on a new machine at `chezmoi apply`.
# Editing this file and running apply re-runs `brew bundle` automatically (via the run_onchange script).
# Note: no --cleanup, add-only, packages you uninstalled by hand won't be reinstalled here.

